Live demo of the `DETAILS` / `SUMMARY` word markers from vocab/html-elements. This tiddler's type field activates the vocabulary.

!! Source

```
DETAILS SUMMARY Click to expand
---
This paragraph is inside the details block.

A second paragraph still inside the same block.
------
```

!! Rendered

DETAILS SUMMARY Click to expand
---
This paragraph is inside the details block.

A second paragraph still inside the same block.
------

See [[Customize an HTML Element]] for the marker schema and the pragma-form alternative.

